.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
.Dd October 18, 2026
.Dt MKFS.MOOBFS 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mkfs.moobfs
.Nd create a read-only MoobFS M1 image
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar new_image
.Ar name Ns = Ns Ar source ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
writes a new read-only image of the first MoobFS milestone (M1), in which separate files can
reference the same immutable bytes.
Each
.Ar name Ns = Ns Ar source
argument adds a file
.Ar name
with the content of the regular file
.Ar source ;
sources with identical content share one stored object.
The tool refuses to overwrite an existing
.Ar new_image .
.Pp
This is the regression milestone of the project, not the stacked layer used for agent memory.
MoobFS is an experimental research project.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 2 on a usage error, non-zero on any other failure.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Dl $ mkfs.moobfs demo.img alpha.txt=memory.txt beta.txt=memory.txt
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr moobfs-attr 1
.Pp
docs/format-m1.md in the MoobFS repository,
.Lk https://github.com/studiomoob/llmoobfs
